    {
        "content": "<p>xia-chao <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14988#issuecomment-6474193318\">commented</a> on <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14988\">PR #14988</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Rebased onto the merged #14908: HTTP/2 requests carry the authority in <code>:authority</code> and often omit <code>Host</code>, so a missing <code>Host</code> is now only an error for HTTP/1.1. Added h2 coverage for missing, duplicate, invalid, and disagreeing <code>Host</code> values.</p>\n</blockquote>",
